### Variables (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client)
@base = http://localhost:8000
@key = change-me-to-a-long-random-string

### Health (no auth)
GET {{base}}/health

### Run code and wait for the result
POST {{base}}/api/v1/executions?wait=true
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "print(sum(range(10)))"}

### Submit asynchronously (202 + Location header)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/executions
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "import time\ntime.sleep(2)\nprint('done')", "timeout_seconds": 10}

### Poll an execution (replace the id)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/executions/exe_REPLACE_ME
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### User-code failure -> status=failed, error_category=user_code_error
POST {{base}}/api/v1/executions?wait=true
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "1/0"}

### Timeout -> status=timed_out
POST {{base}}/api/v1/executions?wait=true
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "while True: pass", "timeout_seconds": 3}

### Agent
POST {{base}}/api/v1/agent/run
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"task": "What is the 20th Fibonacci number? Compute it."}

### Metrics
GET {{base}}/metrics
X-API-Key: {{key}}
